where for a garage); permeable or non-enclosed elements (e.g. porch, verandah, balcony or carport)' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_10A', 'OUTDOOR_STRUCTURE']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES - Part 1 Table 1.6.1 item 6; code note \"AO 3.1 is an alternative provision for P1 within QDC Part MP1.1 Design and Siting Standard for Single Detached Houses – On lots under 450m².\"\nResearcher notes: Small Lot Housing Design Code applies to dwelling houses on lots < 450 m2 in the Low Density Residential and Low-medium Density Residential zones (accepted development subject to requirements under Tables 5.5:1 and 5.5:2 where not in a Schedule 7 plan of development). value field holds the garage figure (5.5 m); carport 3.5 m is in conditions."}$q$::jsonb);
